    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The message is four words. It names no column, no value, no table, and no expected scale, and it is reported as an internal error \u2014 so neither the customer nor support can tell what happened or that the data is the cause."
